            <name>
                <baseName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilation system, Bürohaus Fribourg</baseName>
            </name>
            <classificationInformation>
                <common:classification>
                    <common:class level="0" classId="791c965a-a367-3765-af5c-749f3b9a1d40">waste management</common:class>
                    <common:class level="1" classId="593ec29a-698c-369e-be95-7d8b4d0d7ef7">building demolition</common:class>
                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Disposal of a ventilation system for an office building with offices, common rooms, kitchen, restaurant, auditorium and car park. The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 10161 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 54400 m3/h, total weight of the components: 15755 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 5.4 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including components for air handling units, ducts including insulation, air valves, roof-hoods, dampers, fire dampers, silencers. The data represent a ductwork mainly made of galvanized steel and includes air handling units mainly with heat recovery. System with central air handling units. Building without ground heat exchanger.;
UUID: 5f51097c-7943-4c6c-ac11-f169541964d9</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
